  "details": "Currently, Group Administration Logs can become overwhelming, especially in large groups with thousands of members. While filtering by event type is helpful, there is no way to search logs by a specific username.\n\nSuggested Implementation:\n\nAdd a search bar within the Group Logs tab that allows searching by username.\n\nSupport both full and partial username matches for easier lookup.\n\nOptionally combine with existing log filters (e.g., \"Show all bans for this user\").",
